  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Feature/sub resource route53 recordset by @kabakakao in https://github.com/huseyinbabal/taws/pull/138\n* feat: add Redshift clusters/snapshots support and fix S3 object navigation by @huseyinbabal in https://github.com/huseyinbabal/taws/pull/151\n* fix: add pagination support for EC2 instances listing by @huseyinbabal in https://github.com/huseyinbabal/taws/pull/152\n* feat: ssm param values by @derrike in https://github.com/huseyinbabal/taws/pull/161\n\n## New Contributors\n* @derrike made their first contribution in https://github.com/huseyinbabal/taws/pull/161\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/huseyinbabal/taws/compare/v1.3.0-rc.7...v1.3.0-rc.8",
